  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Lee Gun-Ak, the leader of the bandits of Yeomwangsan Mountain. One day, his family in the mountain village is massacred by assassins who followed Seol-Ji into the mountain. Enraged, Lee Gun-Ak sets out into the world to seek revenge… The star-studded martial arts world is helpless against his unorthodox martial arts. Lee Gun-Ak is learning the martial arts of the Secret Teachings of Seojang, which are different from the martial arts of the Central Plains. The four great disciples of Shindo Sa-Baek, the supreme leader of the martial arts world, Taesanbukdoo Yongseong…\n\nHyo-ryong (俠龍) Yoo Jang-Jin, Muryong (武龍) Dokbul-Gun, Geom-Bong (劍鳳) Gyo-Yeon, and Sipjeolhwanbong (十絶環鳳) Hwa-Su… Even they cannot stop Lee Gun-Ak’s relentless march! Even the female warriors who terrify the martial arts world become mere women before him. The world is shaken by the actions of the fearsome bandit leader, Lee Gun-Ak.\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
